OL,3,GNEWSATories beat Reform UK in council
OL,4,Aby-election win
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have won a Charnwood
OL,7,FBorough Council by-election.
OL,9,FTory candidate James Poland was elected
OL,10,Fas the new councillor for the
OL,11,Fauthority's Wreake Valley ward on
OL,12,FThursday, holding off a challenge from
OL,13,FReform UK's Michael Slade, who finished
OL,14,Fsecond.
OL,16,FThe seat was previously held by the
OL,17,FGreen Party, whose candidate Hamzah
OL,18,FSheikh was pushed into third place.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
